WEBVTT

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:03.330
What do I do?

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:05.260
Ringo-chan, calm down.

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:09.100
I'm sorry. I'm a bit of a moose.

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.110
Did you mean "mess," maybe?

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.990
Sorry. I can't think straight.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:18.600
Why? What happened?

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.870
Well... Um...

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.880
Brother... Brother...

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.240
Brother was abducted!

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.610
A-Abducted?

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:33.120
I-I mean, Ken didn't show up today, but...

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:35.890
She said "abducted," right?

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.410
Which means, at this moment, Sugisaki is...

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:42.490
At this moment, my brother...

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:45.720
Is having fun with her at a hot spring!

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:46.730
Fun with...

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:47.910
Her?

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:49.000
At a hot spring?

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:52.140
Ringo-chan, who is Key-kun with?

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:54.510
Asuka-oneechan.

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:57.640
Asuka...

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:59.780
Senpai's childhood friend...

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:02.510
And the girl he dated in middle school.

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:08.190
That's right. He chose her over me...

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:11.010
...and the student council!

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:48.160
Hello! I made a reservation for Sugisaki Asuka.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:50.520
We've been waiting for you.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.290
Sugisaki-sama and his wife, yes?

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:55.260
No, we're not...

00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:57.430
That's right.

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:01.060
I'll show you to your room.

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:05.510
Hey.

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:06.410
What?

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.170
My darling?

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:10.410
I'm not your darling!

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:12.940
Since when are you Sugisaki Asuka?

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:15.970
We don't want them finding out
that two high school students

00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:17.840
are staying here as a couple, right?

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.680
My darling!

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:23.050
Stop calling me that!

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:25.010
Um...

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:29.060
You two are newlyweds, right?

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:29.560
That's right!

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:32.060
We're so in love.
We never want to be apart.

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:36.830
Where are your rings?

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:41.970
We took them off because
they make it harder to hold hands.

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:43.400
Right, my darling?

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:44.710
Y-Yeah.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.590
Oh my.

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:48.910
You really love each other, don't you?

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:51.460
Yes! Totally!

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:57.720
Totally! Totally!

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:00.350
If this was your plan,

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:04.230
couldn't you have at least
gotten us some prop rings?

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:12.240
Whose fault do you think it is
that she turned around, my darling?

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:16.730
Sugisaki-sama, this is your room.

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:19.450
E-Excuse us!

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:24.920
In other words, he wasn't abducted,
he just went to a hot spring, right?

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.700
Skipping out on Student Council.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:30.520
With the girl he cheated
on in middle school!

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:33.000
I can understand why
Ringo-chan would be worried.

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:37.220
If he's going to a hot
spring with her...

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:40.900
E-Even if that's the case,
that's Key-kun's business, not ours.

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:44.500
E-Even if that's the case,
that's Key-kun's business, not ours.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:48.410
We graduate next week... Why now?

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:51.210
H-He'll be back tomorrow.

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:56.550
B-But what if he doesn't make
it back for graduation?

00:04:56.710 --> 00:04:58.860
Y-You're worrying too much.

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:01.390
Th-That's right. It'll be fine.

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:05.320
Key-kun would never miss our graduation.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:06.560
It's impossible.

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:08.380
He'll come back.

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:13.430
We're going.

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:16.930
It's not fair that only Sugisaki
should get to go to a hot spring!

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:19.330
We're going there, too!

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.170
Yeah!

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:22.800
Great!

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:25.880
Let's get ready, then!

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:26.600
Yeah!

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:27.360
Right.

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:34.740
The view's pretty nice.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:37.950
Hey now.

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:38.750
Ken.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.290
We're all alone, right?

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:44.800
We are.

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.590
And there's only one
thing for lovers to do

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:48.990
when they're alone in a room together.

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:49.980
Yeah.

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:50.940
There is.

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:51.720
Then...

00:05:53.230 --> 00:05:54.210
Let's play a game!

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:58.130
We used to do this all the time.

00:05:58.130 --> 00:06:00.740
I won most of the time, though.

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:03.770
Only because you cheat, Asuka.

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:06.370
I don't cheat, I'm just very good.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.650
What did I just say?

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:11.110
That's not in the rules.

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:12.450
Ken...

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:17.330
You've changed in the last two years.

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:18.710
Asuka...

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:21.610
No changing the subject!

00:06:23.970 --> 00:06:25.390
What are you doing?

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:28.140
If you won't play by
my rules, we're done.

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:30.610
You're as selfish as ever.

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:31.960
Now, now...

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:33.850
You say that, but really,
you're happy to be

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:35.380
playing with me again, aren't you?

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:39.660
Why are you falling asleep?

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:42.020
I'm sleepy.

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:44.230
Hey, Asuka!

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:45.890
This is fun.

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:48.670
This is bad...

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.330
It's been a long time
since we've done this...

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:52.190
It's actually pretty fun!

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:56.170
No! That's what she wants!

00:06:57.690 --> 00:07:00.170
Anyway, what did you want
to talk to me about?

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:01.040
Talk to you about?

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:05.220
Graduation is next week,
so I'm incredibly busy,

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.970
but I came out
here 'cause you called

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:09.050
and said you had something
important to talk about.

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:12.270
Later, when we go to the hot springs.

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:14.910
Don't change the subject!

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:16.540
Tell me.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:20.090
The open air bath here is mixed gender.

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.290
We're going to the bath!

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:28.970
We really came!

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:32.440
I've always wanted to try the baths here.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:35.670
It must be wonderful to bathe while
looking at the snowy mountains.

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:37.340
I'm taking a photo.

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:38.940
Say cheese!

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:42.350
It's fun coming with everybody!

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:43.710
Yeah.

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:49.380
Th-That's right. We're here to find Ken.

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:51.320
I forgot.

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:54.830
The snowy mountains distracted me.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:59.100
Sugisaki!

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:01.430
Is something wrong?

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:04.100
I thought I heard the President...

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:06.050
Of the student council?

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:06.980
Yeah.

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:08.690
But I must be imagining it.

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:12.640
Look, they've got ping pong!

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:14.250
Hot springs ping pong, huh?

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:16.610
Let's play!

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:20.610
Sugisaki Ken-sama and
Matsubara Asuka-sama?

00:08:20.610 --> 00:08:22.580
They should be here.

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:27.470
I'm sorry, but I cannot
answer those questions.

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:28.760
Yeah.

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:31.560
We know they're here, though.

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:33.500
Do we split up and look for them?

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:34.640
Yeah.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.750
Let's check the main bath.

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:37.940
That's a good idea.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.720
Let's take a bath
while we look for him.

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:41.910
It's said the waters here have

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:44.610
the power to turn you from a
side character to a main one.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.440
Mafuyu's going!

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:50.450
Here I go!

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:59.360
Oh my. It says they have
games and ping pong.

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:02.590
If you're at a hot spring,
you have to play ping pong.

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:04.390
Want to go?

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.050
Yeah.

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:07.200
What's this?

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:10.200
It looks like they're having fun.

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:13.170
It tastes like a mix of
curry and white chocolate.

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:15.840
Genghis Kahn Chocolate?

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:18.750
Keychains are very common souvenirs.

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:21.710
A moss ball keychain?

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:23.720
This is common, too, but...

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:26.050
A life-sized, wooden statue of a bear?

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.130
Special Attack!

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:29.080
Wait, wait!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.240
I lose.

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:32.280
Let's go to the bath.

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:32.920
Okay?

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:35.990
It's not here.

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:38.040
My name's not here!

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:39.000
Aka-chan.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:41.700
Let's go to the bath.

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:48.730
Mixed bath... Just thinking
about it gets me excited.

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:50.680
See you inside.

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:52.940
Did you actually believe what I said?

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:54.910
Well, no matter.

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:57.290
Here's the hot spring.

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:59.410
By the way, did you know?

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.120
It's said they appear here...

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:06.200
They come out from the faucet
in the hot springs...

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.210
Do you mean...

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:08.390
Maybe...

00:10:08.390 --> 00:10:09.950
Romans?

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:22.640
It's cold.

00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:26.640
But this warms you up.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:28.570
Nobody's here yet...?

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:31.420
I hope a girl comes soon.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:34.040
The open air bath is reserved?

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:36.650
I wonder if there's a group here.

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:38.830
It must be the Romans.

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:40.160
All right, then.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.930
Let's enjoy the indoor bath.

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:44.180
Yeah.

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:49.490
Aka-chan.

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.070
Be careful, President!

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:55.570
Wash, wash, wash!

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:59.080
Wash, wash, wash!

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:07.100
This is wonderful.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.490
What's wrong, Mafuyu-chan?

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:13.210
I dropped the key to my locker.

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:16.210
You need to keep your key around
your arm or you'll lose it.

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:19.270
What about Key-kun?

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:22.470
Not again...

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:23.970
We totally forgot...

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:25.970
...about Sugisaki.

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:28.270
This is strange...

00:11:28.270 --> 00:11:30.910
Why aren't any girls coming in?

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:31.760
Ken!

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:33.150
Is that you, Asuka?

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.610
Huh? Where are you?

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:37.480
Are you alone over there, too?

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:39.110
Over there?

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:42.350
Are you on the other side?

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:44.820
This isn't mixed gender?

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:46.960
Oh, sorry. I lied.

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:47.810
You lied?

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:50.190
If it's not mixed gender, I'm leaving.

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:51.460
Wait, Ken.

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:53.970
Don't you want to know why I called?

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:56.300
I see.

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:58.310
So you're finally ready to talk?

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:00.140
Okay, out with it.

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:02.830
Do you remember?

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:06.050
The last time I saw you
get hit in the face with

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:07.790
a ping pong ball was our
middle school tournament.

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:10.960
Yeah, it's been a while, so my jaw hurts.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.130
That's not what this is about!

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:16.430
Just spit it out!

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:19.250
Are you sure?

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:20.490
You won't regret it?

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:22.170
What are you talking about?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.590
Is it a bad thing?

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:29.600
Yeah. I'm the only one who
can say it, so I will.

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:31.600
Listen, Ken...

00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:36.270
You'll never be able to have a harem.

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:55.130
How do you know?

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:56.340
I'm going to...

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:58.090
You can't cheat on a girl.

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:01.430
You're the type of person

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:03.630
who can only be happy
if others are.

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:06.180
What's wrong with that?

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:08.010
That's perfect for running a harem.

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:12.450
I'll make lots of girls happy,
and be really happy myself.

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:17.010
Then what if I said I still loved you?

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:23.020
I'd be happy.

00:13:28.020 --> 00:13:30.140
Then only love me.

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:33.050
If I'm not the only one you love...

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:37.810
I can't be happy.

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:44.770
That's exactly what
she said two years ago.

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:50.840
Back then, I loved both Asuka and Ringo,

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:53.440
so I couldn't choose either of them.

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:57.270
And in the end, I hurt both.

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:02.040
But I still can't choose
just one person...

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.630
No, not now...

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:08.900
No.

00:14:15.490 --> 00:14:16.900
Okay, you pass.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:20.710
But how did you come to that answer?

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:23.620
Because...

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:31.120
Because I realized the reason
I want everyone to be happy

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:33.820
isn't out of faithfulness to them.

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:38.620
It's just me being selfish.

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:41.910
You've grown.

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:43.970
But how did you realize?

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:46.990
By spending time with
the student council...

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:49.110
By helping run Hekiyou Academy.

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:50.630
Doing lots of things...

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:56.270
I've really enjoyed the year
I spent with the student council.
Where's Sugisaki?

00:14:57.530 --> 00:15:01.710
Sometimes we'd argue,
but we kept moving forward.

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:06.890
And I realized that this
in itself made me happy.

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:08.590
I see.

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:11.350
So, what will you do now?

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:13.900
What else?

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:16.680
I'll make everyone I love happy.

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:20.500
Of course, that will
mean hurting someone.

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:23.260
So I'll do everything I can to

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:25.660
make them so happy
that I'll forget that.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.150
That is selfish.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:29.150
It is!

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:32.930
And I will still love you,

00:15:32.930 --> 00:15:34.920
but even if you want
me to only love you,

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:38.420
I'm going to keep on
trying to make my harem.

00:15:38.550 --> 00:15:40.740
Which includes you, of course.

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:42.530
You're horrible.

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:44.180
I sure am.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:45.870
But that's who I am.

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:48.420
I see.

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:50.680
So you've decided to make

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:54.090
things as difficult as possible for yourself.

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:55.400
Yeah.

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:56.920
It's not going to be easy.

00:15:57.490 --> 00:15:58.140
Yeah.

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:00.230
You'll hurt a lot of people.

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:01.420
Yeah.

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:05.480
You'll see lots of girls cry,

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:10.430
and you hate that more than anything.

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:13.110
That's what your life is going to be.

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:15.460
I'm ready for it.

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:17.570
I see.

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:23.560
I'd love to meet the people
who made you that way.

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:29.090
We never found senpai.

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:31.340
Or the Romans.

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:33.910
I asked about the bus and train times.

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:34.480
Huh?

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:36.080
Is that...

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:38.880
Sugisaki...

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:39.880
Key-kun...

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:41.540
There he is!

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:42.980
We found him!

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:45.990
Wh-What a coincidence.

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:48.480
Fancy seeing you here.

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:49.990
Are you on a trip, too?

00:16:50.180 --> 00:16:51.710
A trip?

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:54.600
Wait, how did you guys know I was here?

00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:59.350
Ri... Ringo-chan definitely didn't
call us and say you'd been

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.510
abducted by your ex-girlfriend!

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:03.600
That's right.

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:05.940
It doesn't bother me at
all if you decide to go

00:17:05.940 --> 00:17:07.550
to a hot spring with your ex.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:11.000
I definitely wouldn't worry
just because you vanished.

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:12.330
Mafuyu, either!

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:14.690
We didn't come to find you.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:16.020
I see.

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:17.560
They were worried about me.

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:18.420
Ken!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:21.940
Is this the student council
I've heard so much about?

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:24.420
Introduce me.

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:32.440
From the left, Chizuru-san, the President,
Mafuyu-chan, and Minatsu.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:35.740
And this is my childhood friend...

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:36.910
Hi!

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:38.380
I'm Matsubara Asuka!

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:40.970
I'm glad I finally get to meet you!

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:42.450
Why?

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:46.430
I wanted to know what my husband's
mistresses look like.

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:50.050
Mistresses?

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:54.290
But I can see that I'm
prettier, so I'm relieved.

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:57.690
Now, now...

00:17:57.690 --> 00:17:59.650
Let's not just stand here.

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:00.440
Asuka-san.

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:05.650
You called Key-kun your
husband, but he isn't, is he?

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:08.010
You're his ex-girlfriend, right?

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:12.970
We got back together today,
so I'm his current girlfriend.

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:14.280
We did not!

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:16.280
And just what are you
trying to accomplish?

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:17.520
What?

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:20.560
Girlfriend Warriors!

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:22.420
Don't play that game!

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:27.530
And weren't you just telling
me how you'd support my harem?

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:29.890
When we were making out
in the open air baths?

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:34.100
So the open air bath is mixed gender.

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:35.590
It is not!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.340
It's separate!

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.470
Why do you tell lies like that?

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:42.780
You two do look like good friends.

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:46.540
I thought I was the only one

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:49.220
who could make Ken act like that.

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:51.560
No, Minatsu...

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:53.680
this argument isn't like
the ones I have with you.

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:56.620
It's serious! It's from the heart!

00:18:56.620 --> 00:19:01.250
In other words, I'm the only one
Ken's really opened his heart to.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:05.250
To be honest, the position
of "friendly classmate" is

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:08.040
totally outranked by the
position of "childhood friend."

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:10.130
Minatsu!
Onee-chan!

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:11.260
Asuka!

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:13.640
How dare you hurt my sister?

00:19:13.640 --> 00:19:16.870
Is Mafuyu-chan going to
try and avenge Minatsu?

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:19.380
Glance. Glance. Glance.

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:21.970
She's way too shy!

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.350
Okay!

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:25.610
Asuka-san!

00:19:25.610 --> 00:19:26.620
What is it?

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:29.230
Does the useless Mafuyu,

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:32.520
who thinks being pathetic
is cool, have something to say?

00:19:33.390 --> 00:19:34.670
Didn't you know?

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:38.450
That type of girl is only
attractive in novels.

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:40.530
In reality, you're a mess
and nobody likes you!

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:43.620
Mafuyu-chan!

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:44.940
Hey, you!

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:48.340
I don't know if you're Sugisaki's
girlfriend or what, but...

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:51.600
Get lost, childish student
council president who looks

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:53.950
like the main heroine, but was
never able to pull it off.

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:54.970
Ba-boom!

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:56.310
Aka-chan!

00:19:56.310 --> 00:19:57.220
President!
Aka-chan!

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.770
How dare you hurt my Aka-chan?

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:02.930
Your behavior is unacceptable!

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:04.970
Even if you're Key-kun's ex-girlfriend.

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:06.040
His current girlfriend.

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:06.840
Hey!

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:08.960
Who's unacceptable here?

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:10.940
You're basically the only
character in the entire series

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:12.440
who didn't get their own episode.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:15.180
You've been treated worse
than the side characters.

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:18.170
Chizuru-san!

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:19.470
Asuka! You...

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:21.470
That was easy.

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:24.110
I thought they'd be harder than that.

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:25.810
I don't know about that.

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:27.080
What do you mean?

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:30.380
Are we defeated already?

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:33.570
You're bluffing, childish president.

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:35.960
Let's talk more, Asuka-chan.

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:36.920
Yeah!

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.070
It was just getting fun!

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:40.090
Yeah.

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:42.520
You haven't told us about
Key-kun's past, yet.

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:44.020
Mafuyu wants to hear, too!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:47.900
Ken, what is this?

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:50.840
Everybody says they want to talk to you.

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:52.280
Talk to them.

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:57.240
What was Sugisaki like as a kid?

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:59.880
I want to know, too!

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:02.130
Did you always play together?

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:03.580
Did you play doctor?

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:05.250
Wait a second!

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:10.360
We were fighting just now, weren't we?

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:11.860
When was that?

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:13.760
Were we?

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:15.350
But...

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:19.430
President, what were you
doing with Asuka just now?

00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:21.030
What were we doing?

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:23.270
We were having fun talking, like always!

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:30.140
I give up...

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:35.010
I can see why spending a year
with them would change you.

00:21:35.340 --> 00:21:36.380
Yeah.

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:37.650
I lose.

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:39.500
Tell me, Asuka-chan!

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:41.790
What was he like in middle school?

00:21:41.790 --> 00:21:42.730
Okay.

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:44.080
I've got lots of stories.

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:45.020
Really?

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:47.030
I can't wait to hear them!

00:21:47.480 --> 00:21:49.670
The President amazes me, sometimes...

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:54.530
So does everyone else.

00:21:55.860 --> 00:22:00.060
But I'm reminded again of how
lucky I am to be a part

00:22:00.060 --> 00:22:01.800
of the student council.

00:23:38.760 --> 00:23:40.610
You're coming back already?

00:23:40.970 --> 00:23:43.520
Abduct Ringo next time, okay?

00:23:45.330 --> 00:23:46.530
"Abduct"?

00:23:46.530 --> 00:23:50.350
You told Ringo something
weird again, didn't you?

00:23:52.020 --> 00:23:53.370
I see.

00:23:53.370 --> 00:23:54.320
So that's why Ringo thought
"abduct" meant "take on a trip."

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:55.450
Take on a trip

00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:57.360
Abduct

00:23:57.360 --> 00:24:01.360
Does that mean you're still
friends with Ringo-chan?

00:24:01.360 --> 00:24:03.040
Yes. Good friends.

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:05.360
And we're friends now, too, right?

00:24:05.360 --> 00:24:06.630
Of course!

00:24:06.850 --> 00:24:08.220
Did you honestly think I'd say that?

00:24:10.770 --> 00:24:12.420
I was kidding!

00:24:13.140 --> 00:24:14.220
What's that?

00:24:14.220 --> 00:24:16.010
What's wrong, Sugisaki?

00:24:26.010 --> 00:24:28.280
I have a fiancée in my home country, you see.

00:24:28.280 --> 00:24:29.770
That's what people say before they get killed!

00:24:29.770 --> 00:24:32.150
It's the last episode, so somebody has to die!

00:24:32.150 --> 00:24:33.660
Okay, we'll fight to avenge him!

00:24:33.660 --> 00:24:35.490
Next time: The Student Council Doesn't End

00:24:35.490 --> 00:24:37.170
Thanks for watching thus far!

00:24:37.170 --> 00:24:38.860
Ask them to watch next week!
